#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:2
msgid "A control API for the cam"
msgstr "摄像头的控制 API"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:4
msgid ""
"The owner needs to set the motion detector's sensitivity from anywhere -- "
"the wind moves trees more on a windy day. That means routes the dashboard "
"can read the current settings from and post changes to."
msgstr ""
"拥有者需要从任何地方设置运动检测器的灵敏度——刮风的日子里，风会让树木晃动得更厉害。这意味着需要一些路由，让仪表盘能从中读取当前设置，并向其提交更改。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:9
msgid ""
"A small shared state dict on the module is enough to hold the knobs. Later "
"pages add more keys to it; for now there's one:"
msgstr "在模块上放一个小小的共享状态字典就足以保存这些旋钮设置。后面的页面会向其中添加更多键；现在只有一个："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:21
msgid "GET to read, POST to write"
msgstr "用 GET 读取，用 POST 写入"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:23
msgid ""
"A pair of routes -- one ``get``, one ``post`` -- gives the dashboard "
"read/write access to ``state``:"
msgstr "一对路由——一个 ``get``\\ 、一个 ``post``\\ ——让仪表盘对 ``state`` 拥有读/写访问权限："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:48
msgid ""
":attr:`microdot.Request.json` returns the body parsed as JSON, or "
":data:`None` if ``Content-Type`` wasn't ``application/json``. The ``post`` "
"handler walks each failure mode -- missing key, wrong type, out of range -- "
"and bails with :func:`microdot.abort`, which raises "
":class:`microdot.HTTPException` to short-circuit the handler with the given "
"status and message."
msgstr ""
":attr:`microdot.Request.json` 会返回解析为 JSON 的请求主体，如果 ``Content-Type`` 不是 "
"``application/json`` 则返回 :data:`None`\\ 。\\ ``post`` "
"处理函数会逐一检查每种失败模式——缺少键、类型错误、超出范围——并通过 :func:`microdot.abort` 退出，后者会抛出 "
":class:`microdot.HTTPException`\\ ，用给定的状态码和消息使处理函数短路。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:56
msgid "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE"
msgstr "GET、POST、PUT、DELETE"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:58
msgid ""
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.get` and :meth:`~microdot.Microdot.post` are the "
"two we'll use most. :meth:`~microdot.Microdot.put` and "
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.delete` exist for cases that follow REST "
"conventions -- a ``PUT /events/42`` to replace event 42, a ``DELETE "
"/events/42`` to drop it. The handler is otherwise identical."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.get` 和 :meth:`~microdot.Microdot.post` "
"是我们用得最多的两个。\\ :meth:`~microdot.Microdot.put` 和 "
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.delete` 用于遵循 REST 约定的场景——用 ``PUT /events/42`` 替换事件"
" 42，用 ``DELETE /events/42`` 删除它。处理函数在其他方面是相同的。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:65
msgid "Reading query strings and forms"
msgstr "读取查询字符串和表单"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:67
msgid ""
"The dashboard posts JSON, so ``request.json`` is what we want. Two other "
"ways the cam might receive data:"
msgstr "仪表盘提交的是 JSON，所以 ``request.json`` 正是我们想要的。摄像头还有另外两种接收数据的方式："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:70
msgid ""
":attr:`~microdot.Request.args` -- the query string. ``?foo=1&bar=2`` becomes"
" a :class:`microdot.MultiDict` you can read with "
"``request.args.get('foo')``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~microdot.Request.args`\\ ——查询字符串。\\ ``?foo=1&bar=2`` 会变成一个 "
":class:`microdot.MultiDict`\\ ，你可以用 ``request.args.get('foo')`` 来读取它。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:73
msgid ""
":attr:`~microdot.Request.form` -- an HTML form posted as "
"``application/x-www-form-urlencoded``. Same :class:`MultiDict` type."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~microdot.Request.form`\\ ——一个以 ``application/x-www-form-urlencoded``"
" 提交的 HTML 表单。同样是 :class:`MultiDict` 类型。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:77
msgid ""
"The MultiDict is dict-like but lets one key carry multiple values "
"(``?tag=cat&tag=dog`` is two ``tag`` values); see "
":class:`microdot.MultiDict` for the full surface."
msgstr ""
"MultiDict 与字典类似，但允许一个键携带多个值（\\ ``?tag=cat&tag=dog`` 就是两个 ``tag`` 值）；完整接口请参阅 "
":class:`microdot.MultiDict`\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:82
msgid "Dynamic URL segments"
msgstr "动态 URL 段"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:84
msgid ""
"A route path can declare typed placeholders that microdot passes to the "
"handler as extra arguments:"
msgstr "路由路径可以声明带类型的占位符，microdot 会把它们作为额外参数传给处理函数："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:93
msgid ""
"The supported converters are ``<int:>``, ``<re:>`` for a custom regex, "
"``<path:>`` for a segment that can contain slashes, and the default (no "
"prefix) for \"match anything up to the next slash.\" ``<int:event_id>`` "
"accepts ``/events/42`` and rejects ``/events/abc`` -- the rejection becomes "
"a 404 without the handler running."
msgstr ""
"支持的转换器有：\\ ``<int:>``\\ 、用于自定义正则表达式的 ``<re:>``\\ 、用于可包含斜杠的段的 ``<path:>``\\ "
"，以及默认（无前缀）的“匹配直到下一个斜杠之前的任意内容”。\\ ``<int:event_id>`` 接受 ``/events/42`` 而拒绝 "
"``/events/abc``\\ ——被拒绝的请求会变成一个 404，处理函数不会运行。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:101
msgid "Custom error responses"
msgstr "自定义错误响应"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:103
msgid ""
"The default 404 microdot sends is plain ``Not found``. The dashboard expects"
" JSON for every response; override the 404 handler so it returns JSON too:"
msgstr ""
"microdot 默认发送的 404 是纯文本 ``Not found``\\ 。仪表盘期望每个响应都是 JSON；请重写 404 处理函数，让它也返回"
" JSON："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:113
msgid ""
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.errorhandler` takes either a status code (catches "
"every error of that status) or an exception class (catches every handler "
"that raised that exception). The ``(body, status)`` tuple short-circuits the"
" response without constructing a :class:`~microdot.Response`."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.errorhandler` "
"既可以接受一个状态码（捕获该状态的每一个错误），也可以接受一个异常类（捕获每一个抛出该异常的处理函数）。\\ ``(body, status)`` "
"元组会使响应短路，而无需构造一个 :class:`~microdot.Response`\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/control-api.rst:119
msgid "The cam now exposes its state and accepts edits."
msgstr "现在摄像头对外暴露了它的状态，并接受编辑。"
